<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>shop.ayushacharya | Premium Agency Store</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ayushacharya05/shop/refs/heads/main/images/icon.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --brand-primary: #3b82f6;
            --brand-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            --brand-success: #10b981;
            --brand-danger: #ef4444;
            --fonepay-red: #dc2626;
            --bg-main: #f8fafc;
            --bg-surface: #ffffff;
            --text-heading: #0f172a;
            --text-body: #475569;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
            --radius-lg: 16px;
            --radius-md: 12px;
            --radius-sm: 8px;
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-lg: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-main); color: var(--text-body); padding: 0; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* Navigation Header */
        .navbar {
            background: var(--bg-surface);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1300px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .brand-logo i {
            background: var(--brand-gradient);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.5rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
        }

        .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }

        .nav-cart-status {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .nav-cart-status i { color: var(--text-heading); font-size: 1.25rem; }
        .nav-cart-status:hover { border-color: var(--brand-primary); background: #eff6ff; }
        .nav-cart-status.has-items { background: var(--brand-gradient); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25); }
        .nav-cart-status.has-items i { color: white; }

        /* Auth UI Components */
        .google-login-btn {
            background: white;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .google-login-btn:hover { background: #f8fafc; border-color: var(--text-muted); }
        .google-login-btn i { color: #ea4335; }

        .user-profile-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .user-profile-badge img { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
        .user-profile-badge span { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); }

        .logout-trigger {
            background: transparent; border: none; color: var(--text-muted);
            cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.2rem; transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .logout-trigger:hover { color: var(--brand-danger); }

        /* Workspace Grid Layout */
        .main-workspace { max-width: 1300px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
        .store-intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .store-intro h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-heading); letter-spacing: -0.75px; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
        
        .shop-layout-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
        .catalog-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }

        /* Sticky Cart Checkout Panel */
        .checkout-panel-sticky {
            background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);
            transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease; scroll-margin-top: 6rem;
        }

        .checkout-panel-sticky.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        @media (min-width: 992px) {
            .shop-layout-grid.has-items { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1.1fr; display: grid; align-items: start; }
            .checkout-panel-sticky { position: sticky; top: 5rem; }
        }

        .product-premium-card {
            background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .product-premium-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); border-color: var(--brand-primary); }

        .item-meta-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
        .item-meta-header .icon-wrapper {
            background: #eff6ff; color: var(--brand-primary); font-size: 1.3rem;
            padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .product-premium-card:hover .icon-wrapper { background: var(--brand-primary); color: white; }
        .item-meta-header h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); }
        .product-premium-card .desc { color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }

        .dynamic-spec-box { background: #fdfdfd; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; min-height: 150px; }
        .dynamic-spec-box h5 { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
        .dynamic-spec-list { list-style: none; }
        .dynamic-spec-list li { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-body); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
        .dynamic-spec-list li i { color: var(--brand-success); }

        .slider-control-hub { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .slider-meta-tags { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-body); }
        .tier-label-output { color: var(--brand-primary); }
        .custom-range-slider { -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; width: 100%; height: 6px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--border-color); outline: none; margin: 0.6rem 0; cursor: pointer; }
        .custom-range-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand-primary); }
        .live-pricing-counter { text-align: right; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-heading); }
        .live-pricing-counter span { color: var(--brand-primary); }

        .action-add-btn { width: 100%; background: var(--text-heading); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
        .action-add-btn:hover { background: var(--brand-primary); }

        /* Cart Elements */
        .checkout-panel-sticky h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-heading); margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .cart-items-ledger { margin-bottom: 1rem; max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto; }
        .ledger-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 0.6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
        .ledger-row-details h4 { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-heading); }
        .ledger-row-details span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--brand-primary); font-weight: 700; }
        .ledger-row-delete { background: #fff5f5; border: none; color: var(--brand-danger); cursor: pointer; padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }

        .summary-total-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; }
        .summary-total-container .price-tag { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-heading); }

        .form-row-compact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .form-control-block { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .form-control-block label { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
        .form-control-block input, .form-control-block textarea { width: 100%; padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background-color: #f8fafc; outline: none; }
        .form-control-block input:focus, .form-control-block textarea:focus { border-color: var(--brand-primary); background-color: white; }

        .gateway-exclusive-lock { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid #fee2e2; background: #fff5f5; color: #991b1b; padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; }

        .checkout-submit-trigger { width: 100%; background: var(--brand-gradient); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: var(--radius-md); cursor: pointer; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        .checkout-submit-trigger:disabled { background: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }

        /* Customer Dashboard */
        .dashboard-section { background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); margin-top: 2rem; }
        .dashboard-header { border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .dashboard-header h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-heading); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }

        .auth-fallback-box { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 2px dashed var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
        .auth-fallback-box i { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .auth-fallback-box p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .auth-fallback-box .google-login-btn { margin: 0 auto; }

        .orders-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
        .order-card { border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--bg-surface); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
        .order-meta-bar { background: #f8fafc; padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .meta-group span { display: block; }
        .meta-label { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.7rem; }
        .meta-value { color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 700; }
        .order-contents { padding: 1.25rem; }
        .order-item-row { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }

        /* Progress Pipeline Tracker */
        .tracking-pipeline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); position: relative; margin: 2rem 0 1.5rem 0; }
        .tracking-pipeline::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 12.5%; width: 75%; height: 4px; background: var(--border-color); z-index: 1; }
        .pipeline-fill { position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 12.5%; height: 4px; background: var(--brand-success); z-index: 2; transition: width 0.4s ease; }
        .pipeline-node { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; z-index: 3; }
        .node-dot { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: white; border: 3px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; }
        .node-title { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; }

        .pipeline-node.completed .node-dot { border-color: var(--brand-success); background: var(--brand-success); color: white; }
        .pipeline-node.completed .node-title { color: var(--brand-success); }
        .pipeline-node.current .node-dot { border-color: var(--brand-primary); background: white; color: var(--brand-primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); }
        .pipeline-node.current .node-title { color: var(--brand-primary); }

        /* Asset File Delivery System */
        .asset-delivery-hub { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); background: #fafafa; padding: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        @media(min-width: 768px) { .asset-delivery-hub { flex-direction: row; } }
        .delivery-instructions h5 { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); }
        .delivery-instructions p { font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .action-download-btn { background: var(--brand-success); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
        .upload-input-trigger { display: none; }
        .action-upload-btn-label { background: white; color: var(--text-heading); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
        
        .hidden { display: none !important; }
        .loading-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--brand-primary); font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="#" class="brand-logo"><i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i> <span>shop.ayushacharya</span></a>
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <div class="nav-cart-status" id="nav-cart-trigger"><i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i></div>
                <div id="navbar-auth-dock">
                    <button class="google-login-btn" id="login-trigger-btn"><i class="fa-brands fa-google"></i> Sign In</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="main-workspace">
        <div class="store-intro">
            <h1>Premium Digital Solutions Catalog</h1>
            <p>Adjust parameters to find your optimal tier requirements. Sign in to capture dynamic database order logs real-time.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="shop-layout-grid" id="main-layout-wrapper">
            <div class="catalog-grid">
                <div class="product-premium-card" data-id="web_development" data-name="Website Development">
                    <div>
                        <div class="item-meta-header">
                            <div class="icon-wrapper"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i></div>
                            <h3>Web Application Development</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="desc">High-performance responsive systems, interactive backend connections, and robust portals.</p>
                        <div class="dynamic-spec-box">
                            <h5>Included Framework Deliverables:</h5>
                            <ul class="dynamic-spec-list" id="webdev-spec-target"></ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="slider-control-hub">
                            <div class="slider-meta-tags"><span>Plan Tier</span><span class="tier-label-output" id="webdev-tier-txt">Essential</span></div>
                            <input type="range" class="custom-range-slider webdev-step-slider" min="0" max="100" value="0">
                            <div class="live-pricing-counter">Rs. <span id="webdev-price-txt">5,000</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" class="action-add-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add to Cart</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="product-premium-card" data-id="graphic_design" data-name="Graphic Designing">
                    <div>
                        <div class="item-meta-header">
                            <div class="icon-wrapper"><i class="fa-solid fa-bezier-curve"></i></div>
                            <h3>Creative Graphic Designing</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="desc">Bespoke corporate identity solutions, typography sets, vector asset books, and UI packages.</p>
                        <div class="dynamic-spec-box">
                            <h5>Included Design Deliverables:</h5>
                            <ul class="dynamic-spec-list" id="graphic-spec-target"></ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="slider-control-hub">
                            <div class="slider-meta-tags"><span>Plan Tier</span><span class="tier-label-output" id="graphic-tier-txt">Essential</span></div>
                            <input type="range" class="custom-range-slider graphic-step-slider" min="0" max="100" value="0">
                            <div class="live-pricing-counter">Rs. <span id="graphic-price-txt">1,000</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" class="action-add-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add to Cart</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="checkout-panel-sticky hidden" id="checkout-sidebar-panel">
                <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping"></i> Selected Items</h2>
                <div id="cart-nodes-wrapper" class="cart-items-ledger"></div>
                <div class="summary-total-container">
                    <span>Estimated Investment:</span>
                    <span class="price-tag">Rs. <span id="grand-total-ledger">0</span></span>
                </div>
                <form id="store-checkout-form">
                    <div class="form-row-compact">
                        <div class="form-control-block"><label for="usr-name">Full Name</label><input type="text" id="usr-name" placeholder="Name" required></div>
                        <div class="form-control-block"><label for="usr-email">Email Address</label><input type="email" id="usr-email" placeholder="Email" required></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-control-block">
                        <label>Verified Checkout Gateway</label>
                        <div class="gateway-exclusive-lock"><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode"></i> <span>FonePay Secure QR Portal</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-control-block"><label for="usr-notes">Project Instructions</label><textarea id="usr-notes" rows="2" placeholder="Describe instructions..."></textarea></div>
                    <button type="submit" id="submit-order-btn" class="checkout-submit-trigger" disabled>Place Order Request</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dashboard-section" id="customer-portal-anchor">
            <div class="dashboard-header">
                <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear"></i> Customer Order Management Hub (Live DB)</h2>
            </div>
            
            <div id="auth-fallback-view" class="auth-fallback-box">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
                <p>Sign in using your Google Account to check order statuses, download assets, or attach briefings.</p>
                <button class="google-login-btn" id="dashboard-login-btn"><i class="fa-brands fa-google"></i> Sign In via Google</button>
            </div>

            <div id="authenticated-portal-view" class="hidden">
                <div class="orders-container" id="orders-render-dock"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
